      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Having installed solar at a previous house we were very conscious of finding a reputable company that used quality products, provided good after sale service and at a competitive price. Using 'Solarquotes' was the first correct decision we made. All three quotes were excellent, however it came down to install timeline, preferred panels and inverter and previous references. We chose Andrew McIntosh and his team from Amax Electrical and we would have no hesitation in recommending them to anyone wishing to install a solar system. They were knowledgable about their products, quotes professionally, were extremely punctual and polite and left the job site clean and tidy. All correspondence has been submitted and we are very happy with choosing the Fronius inverter as it allows for tracking anywhere and anytime. I am glad Andrew explained the advantages of a quality inverter. We cannot speak highly enough of Andrew and his team at Amax Electrical.",
